From: Gaylon Buckelew <gaylon.buckelew@adtran.com>
Date: Fri, 29 Sep 2023 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] hostapd: expose detailed WiFi client capabilities via ubus

Extend the ubus interface to report comprehensive client capabilities
including HT, VHT, HE, and EHT parameters. Adds get_client_caps method
for capabilities-only queries and vendor IE collection.

Co-developed-by: Vitali Klotschko <vitali.klotschko@adtran.com>
Signed-off-by: Vitali Klotschko <vitali.klotschko@adtran.com>
